    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12295" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποβολ-ή</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆς</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throwing away,</i> e.g. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				943e
			</span></i> sq.; <i>jettison,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.413
			</span></i>; in Gramm., <i>dropping</i> of a letter, etc., <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				55.7
			</span></i>,al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Synt.</u>
					130.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>loss,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτῆσις, χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>La.</u>
					195e
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1115a21
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					75d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Euphro
				1.27
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς τῶν κακῶν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1362a36
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				3.32
			</span></i>.</div>
